1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,140
Hi kids, I'm Qiqi!

2
00:00:02,439 --> 00:00:08,099
Welcome back to Qiqi Meets the Little Prince~

3
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:15,100
Last time, the little prince saw five thousand roses.

4
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:20,260
But he said, none of them were his.

5
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:26,540
Because he had spent so much time with his own rose.

6
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:30,180
Today, the little prince meets a fox—

7
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:35,260
And the fox will teach him something even more wonderful!

8
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:38,820
The little prince walked under the apple trees.

9
00:00:39,119 --> 00:00:41,259
A fox was sitting by the meadow.

10
00:00:41,559 --> 00:00:42,259
Hello there.

11
00:00:42,559 --> 00:00:43,899
Hello, who are you?

12
00:00:44,199 --> 00:00:45,539
I am a fox.

13
00:00:45,839 --> 00:00:47,819
Will you... tame me?

14
00:00:48,119 --> 00:00:50,739
Tame? What does that mean?

15
00:00:51,039 --> 00:00:53,099
To tame means to build ties.

16
00:00:53,399 --> 00:00:56,019
Right now, you're just a little boy to me.

17
00:00:56,319 --> 00:00:57,979
And I don't need you either.

18
00:00:58,279 --> 00:00:59,939
But if you tame me—

19
00:01:00,239 --> 00:01:05,419
Your footsteps will sound like music, calling me out of my burrow!

20
00:01:05,719 --> 00:01:10,739
Wow, footsteps turning into music? That's amazing!

21
00:01:11,039 --> 00:01:12,619
Then what should I do?

22
00:01:12,919 --> 00:01:14,339
You must be patient.

23
00:01:14,639 --> 00:01:17,099
First, sit a little far from me.

24
00:01:17,399 --> 00:01:19,939
Each day, come a little closer.

25
00:01:20,239 --> 00:01:22,299
The little prince sat down.

26
00:01:22,599 --> 00:01:25,779
On the first day, he sat far away.

27
00:01:26,079 --> 00:01:29,819
On the second day, he came one step closer.

28
00:01:30,119 --> 00:01:32,739
On the third day, closer still.

29
00:01:33,039 --> 00:01:37,179
I get it! Making friends takes time!

30
00:01:37,479 --> 00:01:38,499
Then one day—

31
00:01:38,799 --> 00:01:42,219
Look! The color of the wheat fields reminds me of you.

32
00:01:42,519 --> 00:01:46,099
Because your hair is golden, and so is the wheat.

33
00:01:46,399 --> 00:01:51,339
Every time I see the wheat, I'll think of you, and feel warm inside.

34
00:01:51,639 --> 00:01:54,339
The little prince touched his golden hair.

35
00:01:54,639 --> 00:01:56,139
So taming means—

36
00:01:56,439 --> 00:01:58,339
You have a special place in my heart.

37
00:01:58,639 --> 00:02:02,459
Kids, how did you meet your best friend?

38
00:02:02,759 --> 00:02:07,459
Did you get closer little by little too?

39
00:02:07,759 --> 00:02:13,739
Next time, Qiqi and the little prince will... say goodbye.

40
00:02:14,039 --> 00:02:17,139
Good night, see you tomorrow~ ⭐

